     Head-to-head decisive 0-6; absolute 0/40 vs 6/40.
     The package prices minion swings; Mage's minions are
     utility pieces, and face pressure makes them suicide
     into heroes. The package is martial: born on Archer,
     crowned on Warrior, harmful on Mage.

