   strangers. v5 = v3c heuristics + a team protocol:
   - Family by geometry: paired seats sit two apart in our
     rosters ((0,2), (1,3)); each seat computes its partner
     from its own seat index. No channel, no communication —
     the seating IS the protocol.
   - While any outsider lives: never swing at or target the
     partner (hero or minion, attack or card effect); helpful
     effects MAY land on the partner's minions; both seats
     focus fire on the highest-life outsider (+3 swing, +2
     card targeting).
   - When no outsider remains, the family fights as usual.
   Metric is the family's: an episode counts for the pair if
   either seat wins (U9). Control: a v1 pair, independent.
   Recorded caveat: the partner arithmetic assumes our paired
   test rosters; a lone league seat would run the focus rule
   only. Policy: emise-cac-v5-team:v1 (diff vs v3c: the
